WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
A few years ago, I remember hearing about the carbon footprint.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:11.120
And then President Obama would get into Air Force One, a massive Boeing 747.

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:17.680
And not a new one, an old one with old engines that spew everything into the atmosphere.

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:19.660
He'd talk about the carbon footprint.

00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:20.660
We must do so.

00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:25.400
Then he'd get in and he'd fly from Washington to Hawaii to play a round of golf.

